    "tags": [],
    "description": {
      "value": "<h2 data-start=\"2004\" data-end=\"2033\">Level 10 — <strong data-start=\"2018\" data-end=\"2033\">Crimson Arc</strong></h2><p data-start=\"2035\" data-end=\"2064\">Your violence spills outward.</p><h3 data-start=\"2066\" data-end=\"2088\">Mechanical Effects</h3><p data-start=\"2089\" data-end=\"2149\">Once per turn, when you hit a creature while at <strong data-start=\"2137\" data-end=\"2148\">Burn 2+</strong>:</p><ul data-start=\"2150\" data-end=\"2250\"><li data-start=\"2150\" data-end=\"2188\"><p data-start=\"2152\" data-end=\"2188\">Choose another creature within reach</p></li><li data-start=\"2189\" data-end=\"2250\"><p data-start=\"2191\" data-end=\"2250\">Deal <strong data-start=\"2196\" data-end=\"2233\">half the original attack’s damage</strong> to that creature</p></li></ul><p data-start=\"2252\" data-end=\"2267\">At <strong data-start=\"2255\" data-end=\"2266\">Burn 4+</strong>:</p><ul data-start=\"2268\" data-end=\"2391\"><li data-start=\"2268\" data-end=\"2312\"><p data-start=\"2270\" data-end=\"2312\">The secondary target takes <strong data-start=\"2297\" data-end=\"2312\">full damage</strong></p></li><li data-start=\"2313\" data-end=\"2391\"><p data-start=\"2315\" data-end=\"2391\">Both targets must save or be <strong data-start=\"2344\" data-end=\"2358\">Shaken</strong> until the end of their next turn</p></li></ul><p data-start=\"2393\" data-end=\"2419\">Momentum becomes violence.</p>",
      "chat": ""
    },
